{"id":"en_time-with-you-our-turbulent-affair","title":"Time with You: Our Turbulent Affair","titleEn":"Time with You: Our Turbulent Affair","description":"Lin Yang is persuaded by her closest friend to take an overseas trip, and on the flight home she crosses paths with the famous actor Huo Tingshen. Her awkward behavior creates a string of misunderstandings and complications for him, leaving their relationship tense. Back in Haicheng, Lin Yang learns that her villa has been sold, and the new owner is Huo Tingshen himself. Eager to reclaim the property, she fabricates a story about being Lu Yanming's ex-girlfriend, which persuades Huo Tingshen to let her stay. In exchange, she agrees to help him express his feelings to Song Jianing. Yet when the confession takes place, Song Jianing mocks Lin Yang. Angered by the turn of events, Huo Tingshen proposes a contract marriage with Lin Yang, pledging to give the villa back to her afterward. Their tu","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/time-with-you-our-turbulent-affair/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/time-with-you-our-turbulent-affair/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Enemies to Lovers","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinow/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_time-with-you-our-turbulent-affair_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinow/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_time-with-you-our-turbulent-affair_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dinow/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_time-with-you-our-turbulent-affair_3","title":"Episode 3","season"